<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: warped obelisk -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.label>obelisco deformado</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.label>
  <!-- EN: A large metallic pillar that emanates a putrid psychic energy. The pillar hums ominously and appears to be increasing in activity. It's not clear what will happen when it reaches its full capacity.\n\nYou can send colonists to suppress the obelisk to prevent it from activating. You can also mark the obelisk for study to try to learn its purpose and perhaps make use of it.\n\nYou can attack the obelisk to destroy it, but doing so may unleash unnatural and dangerous phenomena. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.description>Um grande pilar metálico que emana uma energia psíquica pútrida. O pilar zumbe de forma agourenta e a sua atividade parece estar a aumentar. Não se sabe o que acontecerá quando atingir a capacidade máxima.\n\nPodes enviar colonos para suprimir o obelisco e impedir que se ative. Também podes marcar o obelisco para estudo, para tentar perceber o seu propósito e talvez tirar partido dele.\n\nPodes atacar o obelisco para o destruir, mas isso pode desencadear fenómenos antinaturais e perigosos.</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.description>
  <!-- EN: Obelisk study progress -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.label>Progresso do estudo do obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Investigation of the obelisk has revealed some information. It is an archotechnological device that seems to interact with organic creatures at a distance. It is probably a piece of a much larger archotech structure that was destroyed or broken apart long ago. The machinery at its core is inhumanly complex and frighteningly powerful. Its purpose and method of action remain totally mysterious.\n\nIf not suppressed, its activity level will increase over time. You can't tell what will happen when the device fully activates. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.text>A investigação do obelisco revelou alguma informação. Trata-se de um dispositivo arcotecnológico que parece interagir à distância com criaturas orgânicas. É provavelmente uma peça de uma estrutura arcotec muito maior, destruída ou desmembrada há muito tempo. A maquinaria no seu núcleo é desumanamente complexa e assustadoramente poderosa. O seu propósito e modo de funcionamento continuam totalmente misteriosos.\n\nSe não for suprimido, o seu nível de atividade aumentará com o tempo. É impossível prever o que acontecerá quando o dispositivo se ativar por completo.</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.text>
  <!-- EN: Obelisk study complete -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.label>Estudo do obelisco concluído</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.label>
  <!-- EN: You've completed your investigation of the obelisk. It creates a bridge to a point in a spacetime void separated from ours along usually inaccessible spatial dimensions.\n\nThe void plane is filled with a gray labyrinthine structure of astronomical scale. Someone trapped there could return by finding the obelisk's mirror version inside the gray rooms and hallways.\n\nThe gray structures seem to have been created by an archotech superintelligence, but there's no way to know their purpose, age, or spatial limits.\n\nThe obelisk is damaged and unstable, so its energy level rises unless suppressed. If it were to fully activate, it could begin to abduct individuals at random.\n\nYou can now intentionally provoke a response from the warped obelisk. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.text>Concluíste a investigação do obelisco. Cria uma ponte para um ponto num vazio espaço-temporal separado do nosso por dimensões espaciais normalmente inacessíveis.\n\nO plano do vazio está preenchido por uma estrutura labiríntica cinzenta de escala astronómica. Alguém que lá fique preso pode regressar se encontrar a versão espelhada do obelisco no interior das salas e corredores cinzentos.\n\nAs estruturas cinzentas parecem ter sido criadas por uma superinteligência arcotec, mas não há forma de saber o seu propósito, idade ou limites espaciais.\n\nO obelisco está danificado e instável, pelo que o seu nível de energia sobe se não for suprimido. Se se ativasse por completo, poderia começar a raptar pessoas ao acaso.\n\nAgora podes provocar intencionalmente uma reação do obelisco deformado.</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.text>
  <!-- EN: Transport a willing person to a distant spatial dimension. It may be difficult for them to return. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateDescString>Transportar uma pessoa voluntária para uma dimensão espacial distante. Pode ser-lhe difícil regressar.</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Teleport... -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateLabelString>Teletransportar...</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: triggering obelisk teleportation: {1}s -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingString>a ativar o teletransporte do obelisco: {1}s</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingString>
  <!-- EN: triggering obelisk teleportation -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingStringPending>a ativar o teletransporte do obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingStringPending>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should do this -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.guiLabelString>Escolhe quem deve fazer isto</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Trigger teleportation -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.jobString>Ativar teletransporte</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.jobString>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has successfully triggered obelisk teleportation. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCompletedString>{PAWN_nameDef} ativou o teletransporte do obelisco.</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCompletedString>
  <!-- EN: The warped obelisk is ready to use again. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCooldownEnded>O obelisco deformado está novamente pronto a usar.</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCooldownEnded>
  <!-- EN: Teleportation cooldown -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.onCooldownString>Recarga do teletransporte</WarpedObelisk_Abductor.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.onCooldownString>
  
  <!-- EN: corrupted obelisk -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.label>obelisco corrompido</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.label>
  <!-- EN: A large metallic pillar that emanates a putrid psychic energy. The pillar hums ominously and appears to be increasing in activity. It's not clear what will happen when it reaches its full capacity.\n\nYou can send colonists to suppress the obelisk to prevent it from activating. You can also mark the obelisk for study to try to learn its purpose and perhaps make use of it.\n\nYou can attack the obelisk to destroy it, but doing so may unleash unnatural and dangerous phenomena. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.description>Um grande pilar metálico que emana uma energia psíquica pútrida. O pilar zumbe de forma agourenta e a sua atividade parece estar a aumentar. Não se sabe o que acontecerá quando atingir a capacidade máxima.\n\nPodes enviar colonos para suprimir o obelisco e impedir que se ative. Também podes marcar o obelisco para estudo, para tentar perceber o seu propósito e talvez tirar partido dele.\n\nPodes atacar o obelisco para o destruir, mas isso pode desencadear fenómenos antinaturais e perigosos.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.description>
  <!-- EN: Obelisk study progress -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.label>Progresso do estudo do obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Investigation of the obelisk has revealed some information. It is an archotechnological device that seems to interact with organic creatures at a distance. It is probably a piece of a much larger archotech structure that was destroyed or broken apart long ago. The machinery at its core is inhumanly complex and frighteningly powerful. Its purpose and method of action remain totally mysterious.\n\nIf not suppressed, its activity level will increase over time. You can't tell what will happen when the device fully activates. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.text>A investigação do obelisco revelou alguma informação. Trata-se de um dispositivo arcotecnológico que parece interagir à distância com criaturas orgânicas. É provavelmente uma peça de uma estrutura arcotec muito maior, destruída ou desmembrada há muito tempo. A maquinaria no seu núcleo é desumanamente complexa e assustadoramente poderosa. O seu propósito e modo de funcionamento continuam totalmente misteriosos.\n\nSe não for suprimido, o seu nível de atividade aumentará com o tempo. É impossível prever o que acontecerá quando o dispositivo se ativar por completo.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.0.text>
  <!-- EN: Obelisk study progress -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.label>Progresso do estudo do obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.label>
  <!-- EN: You've learned more about the obelisk. The device has the power to duplicate intelligent creatures. In theory, it can produce duplicates without limit.\n\nThe obelisk appears damaged and unstable, so its energy level rises unless suppressed. If it were to fully activate, it would go into a duplication loop, chaotically pumping out a large number of flawed human duplicates.\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} thinks that it may be possible to safely shut down the obelisk but this will need significantly more study.\n\nYou can now intentionally provoke a response from the corrupted obelisk. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.text>Descobriste mais sobre o obelisco. O dispositivo tem o poder de duplicar criaturas inteligentes. Em teoria, pode produzir duplicados sem limite.\n\nO obelisco parece danificado e instável, pelo que o seu nível de energia sobe se não for suprimido. Se se ativasse por completo, entraria num ciclo de duplicação, produzindo caoticamente um grande número de duplicados humanos defeituosos.\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} acha que talvez seja possível desligar o obelisco em segurança, mas isso exigirá bastante mais estudo.\n\nAgora podes provocar intencionalmente uma reação do obelisco corrompido.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.1.text>
  <!-- EN: Obelisk study complete -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.2.label>Estudo do obelisco concluído</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.2.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has completed {PAWN_possessive} investigation of the corrupted obelisk. {PAWN_pronoun} has discovered a method for safely deactivating the obelisk using shards of archotechnology.\n\nYou can no longer study the obelisk after deactivating it. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.2.text>{PAWN_nameDef} concluiu a investigação do obelisco corrompido e descobriu um método para o desativar em segurança usando fragmentos de arcotecnologia.\n\nDepois de desativado, o obelisco deixa de poder ser estudado.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompStudyUnlocks.studyNotes.2.text>
  <!-- EN: Provoke the obelisk into duplicating a willing person. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateDescString>Provocar o obelisco para que duplique uma pessoa voluntária.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Duplicate... -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateLabelString>Duplicar...</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: triggering obelisk duplication: {1}s -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingString>a ativar a duplicação do obelisco: {1}s</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingString>
  <!-- EN: triggering obelisk duplication -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingStringPending>a ativar a duplicação do obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.activatingStringPending>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should do this -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.guiLabelString>Escolhe quem deve fazer isto</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Trigger duplication -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.jobString>Ativar duplicação</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.jobString>
  <!-- EN: The corrupted obelisk is ready to use again. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCooldownEnded>O obelisco corrompido está novamente pronto a usar.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.messageCooldownEnded>
  <!-- EN: Duplication cooldown -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.onCooldownString>Recarga da duplicação</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskTriggerInteractor.onCooldownString>
  <!-- EN: Permanently and safely disable the corrupted obelisk. This will prevent it from activating, and from being studied further.\n\nRequires 2 shards. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activateDescString>Desativar o obelisco corrompido de forma permanente e segura. Isto impede que se ative e que continue a ser estudado.\n\nRequer 2 fragmentos.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Deactivate... -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activateLabelString>Desativar...</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: deactivating obelisk: {1}s -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activatingString>a desativar o obelisco: {1}s</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activatingString>
  <!-- EN: deactivating obelisk -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activatingStringPending>a desativar o obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.activatingStringPending>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should do this -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.guiLabelString>Escolhe quem deve fazer isto</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Deactivate obelisk -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.jobString>Desativar obelisco</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.jobString>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has successfully deactivated the obelisk. -->
  <WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.messageCompletedString>{PAWN_nameDef} desativou o obelisco.</WarpedObelisk_Duplicator.comps.CompObeliskDeactivationInteractor.messageCompletedString>
  
